{"id":"a1509c5621540470","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-injective-hull.md","title":"Injective Hull","display":"df-injective-hull — Injective Hull","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-injective-hull","aliases":["58-df-injective-hull"],"display":"df-injective-hull — Injective Hull","depends_on":["[[58-df-essential-extension]]","[[58-df-injective-module]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-injective-hull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-injective-hull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-injective-hull — Injective Hull"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3fc2cb31dd5754f\" href=\"?note=c3fc2cb31dd5754f\" title=\"58-df-essential-extension\">58-df-essential-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"215fb05d088ded8c\" href=\"?note=215fb05d088ded8c\" title=\"58-df-injective-module\">58-df-injective-module</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,E,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\">\\(R,M,E,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\)</span> (ring, module, hull, and encoded module-structure data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InjectiveHull}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{InjectiveHull}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (injective-hull predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\\)</span> (essential-extension predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3fc2cb31dd5754f\" href=\"?note=c3fc2cb31dd5754f\" title=\"58-df-essential-extension\">58-df-essential-extension</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S\\)</span> (injective-module predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"215fb05d088ded8c\" href=\"?note=215fb05d088ded8c\" title=\"58-df-injective-module\">58-df-injective-module</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{InjectiveHull}_S(E,M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\\!\\left(M,\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\\right)\\land\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S(E,R)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{InjectiveHull}_S(E,M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\\!\\left(M,\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\\right)\\land\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S(E,R)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Injective hulls exist for all modules over any ring.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(M)\">\\(E(M)\\)</span> is unique up to isomorphism fixing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> pointwise.</li>\n<li>Over PIDs, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(\\mathbb{Z}) = \\mathbb{Q}\">\\(E(\\mathbb{Z}) = \\mathbb{Q}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}) = \\mathbb{Z}[1/n]/\\mathbb{Z}\">\\(E(\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}) = \\mathbb{Z}[1/n]/\\mathbb{Z}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(M)\">\\(E(M)\\)</span> can be constructed via Baer's criterion or pushouts.</li>\n<li>The upstream essential-extension predicate takes the submodule and one encoded ambient module structure; the repaired clause now uses that exact two-argument signature.</li>\n<li>Essentiality already gives the appropriate minimality; the former comparison <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\leq E&#39;\">\\(E\\leq E&#39;\\)</span> was untyped and is not part of the definition.</li>\n<li>The notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(M)\">\\(E(M)\\)</span> is reserved for a chosen hull satisfying this predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-essential-extension","status":"resolved","id":"c3fc2cb31dd5754f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-essential-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injective-module","status":"resolved","id":"215fb05d088ded8c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-injective-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-essential-extension","status":"resolved","id":"c3fc2cb31dd5754f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S$ (essential-extension predicate, see [[58-df-essential-extension]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injective-module","status":"resolved","id":"215fb05d088ded8c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S$ (injective-module predicate, see [[58-df-injective-module]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M,E,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InjectiveHull}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{InjectiveHull}_S(E,M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\\!\\left(M,\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\\right)\\land\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S(E,R)\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"E(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"E(\\mathbb{Z}) = \\mathbb{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"E(\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}) = \\mathbb{Z}[1/n]/\\mathbb{Z}","display":false},{"tex":"E(M)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\leq E'","display":false},{"tex":"E(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-685","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-injective-hull.md|58-df-injective-hull]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["c3fc2cb31dd5754f","215fb05d088ded8c"]}